---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { u } from '../lib/url';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  eyebrow="Information"
  description="How New Afro handles personal data, cookies, and inquiries received through this site."
>
  <p><em>Placeholder — full migrated privacy policy syncs in the next checkpoint.</em></p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>
    New Afro respects your privacy. We collect only the information necessary
    to operate the site and respond to inquiries you send us — typically your
    name, email address, and the message you choose to share. We do not sell
    or trade personal data.
  </p>

  <h2>Newsletter</h2>
  <p>
    If you subscribe to our newsletter, your email is stored in our mailing
    provider's database and used solely to send you New Afro programming
    updates. You can unsubscribe at any time using the link in any newsletter
    we send.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics &amp; cookies</h2>
  <p>
    The site uses minimal cookies for essential functionality. We may use
    aggregate, anonymous analytics to understand which pages are read most;
    we do not track individual visitors across the web.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Under the GDPR you have the right to access, correct, or delete personal
    data we hold about you. To make a request, write to
    <a href="mailto:cheria@newafro.net">cheria@newafro.net</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
    See also our
    <a href={u('/imprint')}>Imprint</a> and
    <a href={u('/terms-and-conditions')}>Terms and Conditions</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
